# The golden corpus is byte-exact test data, not source code.
#
# `-text` disables git's end-of-line conversion entirely: no CRLF normalisation
# on commit, no re-expansion on checkout. Without this, `crlf-line-endings.yml`
# would be silently converted to LF and the test it exists for would pass
# vacuously on every machine.
*           -text
*.yml       -text
*.yaml      -text

# Keep diffs readable but never let a merge driver rewrite bytes here.
*.yml       -merge
*.yaml      -merge
